 "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >欢迎光临这家变废为宝的奇妙铁匠铺。在这里，废料也能重获新生。通过随心所欲的拆解与组合，你可以锻造出数千种打破常规的旷世神兵。不断升级店面，研习全新配方，以此充实你的军械库。你的任务是满足一众怪咖顾客的需求，无论是巨龙、老奶奶、企鹅还是机器人，通通不在话下。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/29036f28bc539f50c2254b0bd91f2cb7.webp?t=1789877581\" alt=\"Scavenge the trash\" width=203 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在废料堆中翻箱倒柜，搜寻那些最完美的破铜烂铁，为你的下一件传世神兵积攒素材。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/972f78a9f31c1799cbfd8d983304195a.poster.avif?t=1789877581\" aria-label=\"Trash being collected from a trash can\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/972f78a9f31c1799cbfd8d983304195a.webm?t=1789877581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/972f78a9f31c1799cbfd8d983304195a.mp4?t=1789877581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/e2f268843056017a00353c7dce993ca6.webp?t=1789877581\" alt=\"Craft Wacky Weapons\" width=195 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >发挥你的无限创意，让垃圾化腐朽为神奇。小马战锤、饼干盾牌……只有你想不到，没有你造不出。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/55dc5dd85e889d02c0984c01ba63cb45.poster.avif?t=1789877581\" aria-label=\"rhythm minigames being played\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/55dc5dd85e889d02c0984c01ba63cb45.webm?t=1789877581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/55dc5dd85e889d02c0984c01ba63cb45.mp4?t=1789877581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/9aab5bddf07f0330721b47f95ddb1d1e.webp?t=1789877581\" alt=\"Serve unconventional customers\" width=208 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你的作品将销往世界各地，卖给小狗、木乃伊以及各种奇形怪状的怪物！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/cc617851976502f3e2ac97e1312c1d9d.poster.avif?t=1789877581\" aria-label=\"Short clips of different customers\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/cc617851976502f3e2ac97e1312c1d9d.webm?t=1789877581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/cc617851976502f3e2ac97e1312c1d9d.mp4?t=1789877581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/22eb159361104a8c06d4252950ca9293.webp?t=1789877581\" alt=\"Upgrade your store\" width=197 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >向浣熊狄奥根尼采购各种精巧物件，全面升级你的铁匠铺。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/6af827e5adca8246f223e563abfe84e2.poster.avif?t=1789877581\" aria-label=\"The black hole upgrade is bought and then used to clean trash\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/6af827e5adca8246f223e563abfe84e2.webm?t=1789877581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/6af827e5adca8246f223e563abfe84e2.mp4?t=1789877581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >游戏特色</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在垃圾堆中搜寻素材，寻找趁手的锻造材料</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >融合各种部件，打造荒诞不经的神兵利器</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >通过趣味小游戏精益求精，打磨出完美作品</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >将你的武器卖给那些令人印象深刻的怪奇顾客</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >升级铁匠铺，实现垃圾回收再利用的全自动经营模式</p></li></ul>",
 "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >欢迎光临这家变废为宝的奇妙铁匠铺。在这里，废料也能重获新生。通过随心所欲的拆解与组合，你可以锻造出数千种打破常规的旷世神兵。不断升级店面，研习全新配方，以此充实你的军械库。你的任务是满足一众怪咖顾客的需求，无论是巨龙、老奶奶、企鹅还是机器人，通通不在话下。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/29036f28bc539f50c2254b0bd91f2cb7.webp?t=1789877581\" alt=\"Scavenge the trash\" width=203 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在废料堆中翻箱倒柜，搜寻那些最完美的破铜烂铁，为你的下一件传世神兵积攒素材。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/972f78a9f31c1799cbfd8d983304195a.poster.avif?t=1789877581\" aria-label=\"Trash being collected from a trash can\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/972f78a9f31c1799cbfd8d983304195a.webm?t=1789877581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/972f78a9f31c1799cbfd8d983304195a.mp4?t=1789877581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/e2f268843056017a00353c7dce993ca6.webp?t=1789877581\" alt=\"Craft Wacky Weapons\" width=195 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >发挥你的无限创意，让垃圾化腐朽为神奇。小马战锤、饼干盾牌……只有你想不到，没有你造不出。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/55dc5dd85e889d02c0984c01ba63cb45.poster.avif?t=1789877581\" aria-label=\"rhythm minigames being played\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/55dc5dd85e889d02c0984c01ba63cb45.webm?t=1789877581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/55dc5dd85e889d02c0984c01ba63cb45.mp4?t=1789877581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/9aab5bddf07f0330721b47f95ddb1d1e.webp?t=1789877581\" alt=\"Serve unconventional customers\" width=208 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你的作品将销往世界各地，卖给小狗、木乃伊以及各种奇形怪状的怪物！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/cc617851976502f3e2ac97e1312c1d9d.poster.avif?t=1789877581\" aria-label=\"Short clips of different customers\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/cc617851976502f3e2ac97e1312c1d9d.webm?t=1789877581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/cc617851976502f3e2ac97e1312c1d9d.mp4?t=1789877581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/22eb159361104a8c06d4252950ca9293.webp?t=1789877581\" alt=\"Upgrade your store\" width=197 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >向浣熊狄奥根尼采购各种精巧物件，全面升级你的铁匠铺。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/6af827e5adca8246f223e563abfe84e2.poster.avif?t=1789877581\" aria-label=\"The black hole upgrade is bought and then used to clean trash\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/6af827e5adca8246f223e563abfe84e2.webm?t=1789877581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/6af827e5adca8246f223e563abfe84e2.mp4?t=1789877581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >游戏特色</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在垃圾堆中搜寻素材，寻找趁手的锻造材料</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >融合各种部件，打造荒诞不经的神兵利器</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >通过趣味小游戏精益求精，打磨出完美作品</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >将你的武器卖给那些令人印象深刻的怪奇顾客</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >升级铁匠铺，实现垃圾回收再利用的全自动经营模式</p></li></ul>",
 "short_description": "《变废为宝工坊》是一款铁匠铺经营模拟游戏。你将化身变废为宝的匠人，在堆积如山的垃圾中翻找素材，亲手打造出万余种荒诞不经的奇葩兵器——无论是香蕉长剑还是飞盘盾牌，只有想不到，没有造不出。在这里，你可以升级店铺、解锁神兵谱，并将这些稀奇古怪的作品卖给品味独特的顾客，比如西装革履的水獭或是神秘的意面怪。",
 "supported_languages": "英语, 西班牙语 - 拉丁美洲, 日语, 简体中文, 法语, 意大利语, 德语, 韩语, 葡萄牙语 - 巴西, 葡萄牙语 - 葡萄牙, 繁体中文, 土耳其语",
